# laramie — the ANSI-16 contract. see .claude/skills/laramie/references/spec.md §4.
#
# ⚠ this is the most leveraged file in the theme. every tool that takes ANSI colour NAMES
# inherits these — starship, git log's %C(brightblack), LS_COLORS, EZA_COLORS, grc, gh, and
# every TUI — including tools laramie never configures. do not hex-code those; fix them here.
#
# ⚠ normals are the `base` tier, brights are the `loud` tier. until 2026-07-30 slots 9-14 were
# byte-identical to 1-6, so six of sixteen did no work. re-collapsing them is a regression.
# ⚠ slot 8 (brblack) is text.dim at 4.53:1, NOT a border colour. it used to hold a surface-ramp
# value at 1.74:1 — effectively invisible — and it is what most tools use for secondary TEXT.

